      },
      {
        "y": 577,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 538.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "1 The princess swept into the room like a galleon in full sail. Was the princess (a) small and awkward"
      },
      {
        "y": 589,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 226.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "or (b) large and stately?"
      },
      {
        "y": 601,
        "x0": 116.2,
        "x1": 516.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "2 He doesn’t mind criticism and it’s often hard to penetrate his armour. Is the person described"
      },
      {
        "y": 613,
        "x0": 127.6,
        "x1": 347.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "likely to be (a) thick-skinned or (b) physically strong?"
      },
      {
        "y": 625,
